<hgroup><h1>Meta-analysis fine-mapping is often miscalibrated at single-variant resolution</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Kanai%20M"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Masahiro Kanai</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
